  (text "+3V3 and GND: power, MCU and driver\nI2C_SCL / I2C_SDA / LED_EN: MCU to driver\nLED_COL1..10 / LED_ROW1..9: driver to array\nNFC_AC0 / NFC_AC1: isolated passive RF circuit"
    (at 279.4 151 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.27 1.27))
      (justify left))
    (uuid "aa658b96-4bc4-54f4-a357-ae9070598f64"))
  (text "BUILD NOTES"
    (at 20.32 205.74 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.8 1.8))
      (justify left))
    (uuid "42bb4719-c56a-56f7-b826-9d64cddbdbf0"))
  (text "USB supplies power only. Program through SWD with target powered by USB.\nDriver firmware: R_EXT = 20k, GCC = 0x20 (32); unused channels off.\nNFC L1 is a printed loop; the routed antenna still requires measured tuning. C30 is DNP initially.\nNo battery, charger, USB data or USB-PD negotiation. QR and appearance belong to PCB artwork.\nAll circuits are native editable KiCad symbols and wires. Engineering checks accompany exports."
    (at 20.32 218.44 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.27 1.27))
      (justify left))
